## Upstream

COMPUTEX.md is built on [Taiwan.md](https://github.com/frank890417/taiwan-md)
(site code MIT, content CC BY-SA 4.0). We took the code and cleared the content:
`knowledge/` was emptied at genesis and every article here is written from scratch.
No CC BY-SA text from upstream is redistributed, so its ShareAlike condition does not
attach to our content.

Documentation under `docs/pipelines/`, `docs/editorial/` and `docs/fork/` is retained
from upstream as method reference and remains under **CC BY-SA 4.0**, attributed to
Taiwan.md.

